# Spotcycle Scouter: "When this Vehicle enters, scry 2." (CR 701.22a) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with two Moxes; the scry looks at
# Lightning Bolt and Counterspell, and Bot1 keeps Counterspell on top and bottoms the Bolt, so Counterspell is the card drawn on
# turn 3. "Crew 1" (CR 702.122a): on turn 3 the summoning-sick Memnite (power 1) taps to crew the 3/2 Vehicle, which attacks
# Bot2 and deals 3.

